cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "dhn-benchmark: Synthetic benchmark networks for district heating systems"
abstract: >-
  Seven synthetic district heating network archetypes (3G_R_S, 3G_L_S, 3G_M_S,
  3G_M_M, 4G_M_M, 5G_M_M, 3G_M_L) for validating and comparing thermo-hydraulic
  simulation tools, with the generation scripts (Methodology I and II) and the
  pyDHN reference results. Companion repository of the paper "Synthetic Benchmark
  Networks for District Heating Systems: A Systematic Review and Standardisation
  Framework".
authors:
